{"unit_id":"tag:076V:statement","translation":"<MATH_0001>\n和<MATH_0002>共同的底层范畴（underlying category）记为<MATH_0003>（参见\n《叠（Stacks）上的层（Sheaves）》第<REF_0001>节及\n《拓扑（Topologies）》注记<REF_0002>）。设<MATH_0004>为\n<MATH_0005>的对象（object）。设\n<MATH_0006>\n为满足以下性质的群胚纤维范畴（category fibred in groupoids）：\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002><MATH_0007>为<MATH_0008>上的取值于群胚（groupoids）的叠（stack），\n<STRUCT_0003>对角态射（diagonal）<MATH_0009>\n可由代数空间（algebraic spaces）表示（representable）<FOOTNOTEOPEN_0001>这里既可指平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）拓扑（topology）中的层（sheaves），其对角态射（diagonal）可表（representable），且有一个概形（scheme）给出的平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）满射（surjective）覆盖（covering）；也可指\n《代数空间（Algebraic Spaces）》定义<REF_0003>\n所定义的代数空间（algebraic spaces）。\n具体说来，由《逐步构造》引理<REF_0004>，\n二者没有区别。<FOOTNOTECLOSE_0001>，以及\n<STRUCT_0004>存在<MATH_0010>\n及<MATH_0011>-态射（morphism）<MATH_0012>，\n它满射（surjective）且光滑（smooth）。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n则<MATH_0013>是《代数栈（Algebraic Stacks）》定义<REF_0005>\n意义下的代数栈（algebraic stack）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"underlying category","target_term":"底层范畴"},{"source_term":"Stacks","target_term":"叠"},{"source_term":"Sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"category fibred in groupoids","target_term":"群胚纤维范畴"},{"source_term":"groupoids","target_term":"群胚"},{"source_term":"stack","target_term":"叠"},{"source_term":"diagonal","target_term":"对角态射"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"表示"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"diagonal","target_term":"对角态射"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0002>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"Algebraic Spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"},{"source_term":"Algebraic Stacks","target_term":"代数栈"},{"source_term":"algebraic stack","target_term":"代数栈"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"underlying category","target_term":"底层范畴","context":"076V：待决"},{"source_term":"Stacks","target_term":"叠","context":"076V：章节名"},{"source_term":"Sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"076V：章节名"},{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑","context":"076V：章节名"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象","context":"076V：待决"},{"source_term":"category fibred in groupoids","target_term":"群胚纤维范畴","context":"076V：待决"},{"source_term":"groupoids","target_term":"群胚","context":"076V：待决"},{"source_term":"stack","target_term":"叠","context":"076V：待决"},{"source_term":"diagonal","target_term":"对角态射","context":"076V：待决"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"076V：待决"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"表示","context":"076V：可由代数空间表示"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"076V：待决"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"076V：待决"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"076V：待决"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表","context":"076V：对角态射的性质"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"076V：待决"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0002>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"076V：待决"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"076V：待决"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"076V：待决"},{"source_term":"Algebraic Spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"076V：章节名"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"076V：待决"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑","context":"076V：待决"},{"source_term":"Algebraic Stacks","target_term":"代数栈","context":"076V：章节名"},{"source_term":"algebraic stack","target_term":"代数栈","context":"076V：待决"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:076V:proof","translation":"注意，引理中的性质（2）和（3）及《代数栈（Algebraic Stacks）》定义<REF_0001>\n中对应的性质（2）和（3）均与拓扑（topology）无关。\n这是因为这些性质只涉及群胚（groupoids）纤维范畴（categories）的<MATH_0001>-纤维积（fibre product）、\n群胚（groupoids）纤维范畴（categories）的<MATH_0002>-及<MATH_0003>-态射（morphisms）、\n群胚（groupoids）纤维范畴（categories）的<MATH_0004>-态射（morphism）可由代数空间（algebraic spaces）表示（representable）的概念，\n以及这样的<MATH_0005>-态射（morphism）满射（surjective）且光滑（smooth）的含义。\n因此，只须证明具有性质（2）和（3）的平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）群胚（groupoids）叠（stack）\n<MATH_0006>也是一个fppf群胚（groupoids）叠（stack）。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n由（2），取代数空间（algebraic space）<MATH_0007>表示\n<MATH_0008>。\n由（3），投影（projections）<MATH_0009>光滑（smooth）。与\n《代数栈（Algebraic Stacks）》引理<REF_0002>\n的证明完全相同，可构造空间中的群胚（groupoid）<MATH_0010>和典范（canonical）的\n全忠实（fully faithful）<MATH_0011>-态射（morphism）<MATH_0012>，\n其中<MATH_0013>是平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）叠化（stackification），其原像为取值于群胚（groupoids）的预层（presheaf）\n<MATH_0014>。\n断言：若<MATH_0015>为满射（surjective）、光滑（smooth）的态射（morphism），从代数空间（algebraic space）\n<MATH_0016>到概形（scheme）<MATH_0017>，则存在平展（<ACCENT_0003>tale）覆盖（covering）<MATH_0018>，\n它加细（refining）覆盖（covering）<MATH_0019>。这由\n《态射（Morphisms）续论》引理<REF_0003>\n或更一般的\n《叠（Stacks）上的层（Sheaves）》引理\n<REF_0004>得到。\n使用此断言，并与\n《代数栈（Algebraic Stacks）》引理<REF_0005>\n完全相同地论证，可知<MATH_0020>为\n等价（equivalence）。\n\n<STRUCT_0003><STRUCT_0004>\n接下来，以<MATH_0021>表示fppf拓扑（topology）中的商叠（quotient stack），\n它由《代数栈（Algebraic Stacks）》定理\n<REF_0006>\n是代数栈（algebraic stack）。\n因此有<MATH_0022>-态射（morphisms）\n<MATH_0023>。\n<MATH_0024>和\n<MATH_0025>均满射（surjective）且光滑（smooth）（前者由假设，后者由定理），且在两种情形中，\n纤维积（fibre product）<MATH_0026>及<MATH_0027>\n均可由<MATH_0028>表示（representable）。因此，<MATH_0029>-态射（morphism）\n<MATH_0030>全忠实（fully faithful）（因为\n商叠（quotient stacks）中的态射（morphisms）由到<MATH_0031>的态射（morphisms）给出，参见\n《空间中的群胚（Groupoids）》第\n<REF_0007>节）。\n\n<STRUCT_0005><STRUCT_0006>\n最后，对任意概形（scheme）<MATH_0032>和态射（morphism）<MATH_0033>，纤维积（fibre product）\n<MATH_0034>是代数空间（algebraic space），它在<MATH_0035>上满射（surjective）且光滑（smooth）。\n由上述断言，存在平展（<ACCENT_0004>tale）覆盖（covering）<MATH_0036>\n及态射（morphisms）<MATH_0037>，它们位于<MATH_0038>之上。这证明，对象（object）\n<MATH_0039>属于<MATH_0040>在<MATH_0041>上的纤维，并平展（<ACCENT_0005>tale）局部地来自<MATH_0042>。可知\n<MATH_0043>在<MATH_0044>上的群胚（groupoids）叠（stacks）之间是等价（equivalence），由《叠（Stacks）》引理<REF_0008>可得。\n证明完成。\n","allowed_english":["fppf"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Algebraic Stacks","target_term":"代数栈"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"groupoids","target_term":"群胚"},{"source_term":"categories","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"fibre product","target_term":"纤维积"},{"source_term":"groupoids","target_term":"群胚"},{"source_term":"categories","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"groupoids","target_term":"群胚"},{"source_term":"categories","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"表示"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"groupoids","target_term":"群胚"},{"source_term":"stack","target_term":"叠"},{"source_term":"groupoids","target_term":"群胚"},{"source_term":"stack","target_term":"叠"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"projections","target_term":"投影"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"},{"source_term":"Algebraic Stacks","target_term":"代数栈"},{"source_term":"groupoid","target_term":"群胚"},{"source_term":"canonical","target_term":"典范"},{"source_term":"fully faithful","target_term":"全忠实"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0002>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"stackification","target_term":"叠化"},{"source_term":"groupoids","target_term":"群胚"},{"source_term":"presheaf","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_